# {{skill_name}} - INIT

Verify access to the reactive runtime.

## Instructions
1. Prefer AXI CLI.
2. Run `reactive-skills-axi state {{skill_name}}` to inspect this job, or `reactive-skills-axi invoke {{skill_name}}` to start a fresh isolated job.
3. If this is named or parallel work, choose a job ID and keep `--job <job-id>` on every `state` and `emit` command.
4. Use MCP tools only when shell access to AXI is unavailable.
5. If AXI or MCP runtime access works, emit `RUNTIME_READY`.
6. If neither path works, emit `SETUP_REQUIRED`.
